[{"text":"QCDFeynmanRuleConvention fixes the sign convention in the QCD Feynman rules for the ghost propagator and the ghost-gluon vertex.This is done by setting the value of QCDFeynmanRuleConvention[GhostPropagator] and QCDFeynmanRuleConvention[GluonGhostVertex].","anchor":"qcdfeynmanruleconvention"},{"text":"The default values are 1 for both, which corresponds to the convention used in most books. Setting them to -1 enforces the convention that can be found e.g. in the book “Applications of Perturbative QCD” by R. Field.","anchor":"qcdfeynmanruleconvention"},{"text":"Overview, GluonGhostVertex, GhostPropagator.","anchor":"see-also","section":"See also"},{"text":"Enforce the convention as in “Applications of Perturbative QCD” by R. Field.","anchor":"examples","section":"Examples"},{"text":"QCDFeynmanRuleConvention[GhostPropagator] = -1; QCDFeynmanRuleConvention[GluonGhostVertex] = -1;","anchor":"cb1","section":"Examples"},{"text":"GHP[p, a, b] // Explicit","anchor":"cb2","section":"Examples"},{"text":"\\[-\\frac{i \\delta ^{ab}}{p^2}\\]","anchor":"cb2-1","section":"Examples"},{"text":"GGV[{p, \\[Mu], a}, {q, \\[Nu], b}, {k, \\[Rho], c}] // Explicit","anchor":"cb3","section":"Examples"},{"text":"\\[g_s k^{\\mu } f^{abc}\\]","anchor":"cb3-1","section":"Examples"},{"text":"Back to the standard convention.","anchor":"cb3-1","section":"Examples"},{"text":"QCDFeynmanRuleConvention[GhostPropagator] = 1 QCDFeynmanRuleConvention[GluonGhostVertex] = 1","anchor":"cb4","section":"Examples"},{"text":"\\[1\\]","anchor":"cb4-3","section":"Examples"},{"text":"\\[1\\]","anchor":"cb4-3","section":"Examples"},{"text":"GHP[p, a, b] // Explicit","anchor":"cb5","section":"Examples"},{"text":"\\[\\frac{i \\delta ^{ab}}{p^2}\\]","anchor":"cb5-1","section":"Examples"},{"text":"GGV[{p, \\[Mu], a}, {q, \\[Nu], b}, {k, \\[Rho], c}] // Explicit","anchor":"cb6","section":"Examples"},{"text":"\\[g_s \\left(-k^{\\mu }\\right) f^{abc}\\]","anchor":"cb6-1","section":"Examples"}]